    "intro_narrative": "The sky has been ash-grey for twenty years. Scavenging the ruins of the Old World, you stumble upon a reinforced bunker door, slightly ajar. Inside, the air filters are humming—a sound you haven't heard since you were a child. Rumor has it this forgotten outpost holds the location of 'Eden,' the last radiation-free zone left on the continent. You stand inside the command center, but the systems are in lockdown. The backup generator is running on fumes; you must retrieve the coordinates before the power fails and the airlock seals you in forever.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
